    heading: "method-30",
    content: "The expiration time of the lock. The value is in seconds, ranging from \\[10 to 300]. When the user who owns the lock goes offline, if the user returns to the channel within the time they can still use the lock; otherwise, the lock is released and the users who listen for the `OnLockEvent` event receives the `RELEASED` @event."
